+/**
+ * Focused executable evidence for product-scope cards changed between the
+ * ManaLoom XMage transition pins 34d81ea and 2c43ec8.
+ *
+ * Planetarium is deliberately represented by a quarantine assertion that
+ * records the confirmed optional-trigger regression. This class does not
+ * change card sources and that assertion is not promotion evidence.
+ */
+public class XmagePinProductScopeTransitionTest extends CardTestPlayerBase {
